<tr>
<td>
<p>Wichita State's Bachelor of Science in Nursing (BSN) prepares you for entry-level professional nursing positions in a variety of health care settings and provides a foundation for graduate study in nursing. The program combines CCNE accreditation, experienced instructors, exclusive scholarships &mdash; and applied learning in Kansas' health care hub.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>
<h3 class="heading4">Learn how nursing is the right fit for you.</h3>
<table class="ou-snippet-generic-button-collection"><caption>Button Collection</caption>
